      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Residents enjoy low‑maintenance, lock‑and‑leave living, with monthly fees covering taxes, insurance, water, sewer, lawn care, snow removal, and bus transportation.",
